sequenceDiagram
    participant HTTPClient as HTTP Client
    participant GRPCClient as gRPC Client
    participant Uvicorn as uvicorn<br/>8000/TCP
    participant TGISAdapter as vllm_tgis_adapter<br/>8033/TCP
    participant VLLMEngine as vLLM Inference Engine
    participant Spyre as IBM Spyre<br/>Accelerator
    participant HFHub as Hugging Face Hub<br/>HTTPS
    participant Volume as Pre-mounted<br/>Volume

    Note over VLLMEngine,Volume: Container Startup - Model Loading
    alt Model from Hugging Face Hub
        VLLMEngine->>HFHub: Download model weights<br/>HTTPS
        HFHub-->>VLLMEngine: Model artifacts
    else Model from pre-mounted volume
        VLLMEngine->>Volume: Load model weights<br/>Local filesystem
        Volume-->>VLLMEngine: Model artifacts
    end
    VLLMEngine->>Spyre: Load model onto accelerator

    Note over HTTPClient,Spyre: Runtime - OpenAI-Compatible HTTP Inference
    HTTPClient->>Uvicorn: POST /v1/completions<br/>HTTP :8000
    Uvicorn->>VLLMEngine: Route inference request
    VLLMEngine->>Spyre: Execute model inference
    Spyre-->>VLLMEngine: Inference result
    VLLMEngine-->>Uvicorn: Completion response
    Uvicorn-->>HTTPClient: JSON response

    Note over GRPCClient,Spyre: Runtime - TGIS-Compatible gRPC Inference
    GRPCClient->>TGISAdapter: GenerateRequest<br/>gRPC :8033
    TGISAdapter->>VLLMEngine: Route inference request
    VLLMEngine->>Spyre: Execute model inference
    Spyre-->>VLLMEngine: Inference result
    VLLMEngine-->>TGISAdapter: Inference result
    TGISAdapter-->>GRPCClient: GenerateResponse
